---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Portrait from '../../components/Portrait.astro';
import { LINKEDIN } from '../../i18n/textes';
---

<Base
  page="aPropos"
  langue="en"
  titre="About"
  description="Jean Perrier’s background and way of working."
>
  <article class="conteneur fiche">
    <div class="fiche__portrait"><Portrait /></div>
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="fiche__texte">
      <p>
        Since 2024, I have been Head of Product at GlobalExam, a B2B SaaS scale-up in online language learning. From
        2022 to 2024, I was a Product Manager and Data Product Owner there.
      </p>
      <p>
        I lead a team of Product Managers and Product Designers, from discovery to release, and I run the team
        that turns user feedback into prioritized fixes.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before that, I built digital public services for the French government: at DINUM, the Observatoire de la
        qualité des démarches en ligne, which tracks the quality of online public services, and “Je donne mon avis”;
        then at DITP, Services publics +.
      </p>
      <p>
        I build on hypotheses: I listen, I test, then I invest where it counts. AI is one of my tools when it brings something
        concrete: sorting feedback, auditing content, prototyping a feature.
      </p>
      <p>Educated at Sciences Po Paris (Master’s in Public Affairs). Fluent in English.</p>
      <p>Get in touch on <a href={LINKEDIN}>LinkedIn</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
